msgid ""
"Only use course markup for educational content that fits the following "
"definition of a course: A series or unit of curriculum that contains "
"lectures, lessons, or modules in a particular subject and/or topic."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin/admin-metaboxes.php:1503
msgid ""
"A course must have an explicit educational outcome of knowledge and/or skill "
"in a particular subject and/or topic, and be led by one or more instructors "
"with a roster of students."
